## Why This Is Asked
This tests applying privacy-preserving analytics in a real Azure data lakehouse while keeping per-tenant governance and RBAC, plus testing and rollback strategies.

## Key Concepts
- Differential privacy at aggregation
- Per-tenant epsilon budgets stored in App Configuration
- Budget ledger and enforcement
- Access control with Unity Catalog RBAC
- End-to-end test strategy and rollback

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example: rough DP noise application (Gaussian approximation)
function gaussianNoise(scale) {
  // Box-Mellin or CLT-based approximation
  let u1 = Math.random(), u2 = Math.random();
  return scale * Math.sqrt(-2 * Math.log(u1)) * Math.cos(2 * Math.PI * u2);
}
function addDp(value, epsilon) {
  const scale = 1.0 / Math.max(1e-6, epsilon);
  return value + gaussianNoise(scale);
}
```

